/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This book is not just written, it was taught and lived. I have the privilege of mentoring an exceptional team of young men and women over different times on certain onsite and online platforms. It is relevant parts of the content taught over the years at these platforms, that were worked into the books, of which this is one. I want to appreciate these uncommon proteges and everyone at the Wisdom Place, House of Insights, and other mentoring platforms, most of whom were the first set of people I shared the insights that were harvested into the pages of this book. )
/E (This book is not just written, it was taught and lived. I have the privilege of mentoring an exceptional team of young men and women over different times on certain onsite and online platforms. It is relevant parts of the content taught over the years at these platforms, that were worked into the books, of which this is one. I want to appreciate these uncommon proteges and everyone at the Wisdom Place, House of Insights, and other mentoring platforms, most of whom were the first set of people I shared the insights that were harvested into the pages of this book. )
